Description: A Shiny-based user interface for nlmixr2, allowing users to
    build pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic
    (PK/PD) models interactively. This package simplifies model specification,
    parameter estimation through a shiny
    interface. It integrates tools from nlmixr2, nlmixr2lib, and rxode2 with
    enhanced user interactivity using Shiny, shinyjs, and waiter for smooth
    UI experience.
